<!--
  PerfPowerServices (PowerLog) DataDonation metadata for ToolKit indexing
  telemetry (rdar://179251502 / rdar://171634254).

  Declares the frozen SiriTools/Indexing metric schema so PerfPowerServices can
  log/store/read the per-bundle / per-stage indexing telemetry the indexer
  donates from IndexingLog's PerfPowerServicesTelemetrySink
  (ShortcutsServices/ToolKit/Database/Indexing/Log/IndexingLog.swift).

  Installed on-device at /System/Library/PerfPowerTelemetry/MetadataReports via a
  "Copy only when installing" Copy Files build phase on BackgroundShortcutRunner
  (iOS/macOS) and toolkitd (watchOS). See
  https://docs.apple.com/documentation/perfpowerservices/dynamicdatadonation#Metadata-PLIST

  Fields mirror the frozen 10-key payload. The reserved key
  __pps_timeSensitiveEntryDate is NOT a declared metric (it only sets the entry
  timestamp). datatype: 3=string, 4=date, 7=integer. storage 2=Powerlog DB (PLSQL).
  mode 1=All. enabledPopulation 3=Internal&Seed&RC. appIdentifier 1=BundleID,
  3=ProcessName. privacyClassification/dmaCompliant follow privacy review
  rdar://171634254 — confirm before shipping to customers.
-->
